T*
(## Third Move: Community college apprenticeship / pathway programs) Tj
T*
(Why third:) Tj
T*
(- strongest higher-ed-adjacent expansion lane) Tj
T*
(- better employer linkage and pathway realism than generic higher ed) Tj
T*
(- more repeatable than elite co-op institutions) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Indicative economics:) Tj
T*
(- likely ACV: `$150K-$350K`) Tj
T*
(- top strategic systems: `$350K-$750K`) Tj
T*
(- rough TAM: `$35M-$75M`) Tj
T*
(- rough SAM: `$12M-$25M`) Tj
T*
(- rough SOM: `$3M-$8M`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Fourth Move: Large employers with strategic workforce planning pain) Tj
T*
(Why not first despite high commercial value:) Tj
T*
(- highest direct commercial upside in the set) Tj
T*
(- strongest long-run ACV profile) Tj
T*
(- but slower proof, higher integration burden, and harder outcomes-data access) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Indicative economics:) Tj
T*
(- likely ACV: `$500K-$1.5M`) Tj
T*
(- top strategic accounts: `$1.5M-$5M+`) Tj
T*
(- rough TAM: `$750M-$2B`) Tj
T*
(- rough SAM: `$150M-$400M`) Tj
T*
(- rough SOM: `$15M-$50M`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Fifth Move: Higher-ed institutions with co-op / externship outcome closure) Tj
T*
(Why later:) Tj
T*
(- high-quality individual targets exist) Tj
T*
(- but the category is narrower and more outlier-dependent) Tj
T*
(- less repeatable as a broad GTM lane than community college pathways) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Indicative economics:) Tj
T*
(- likely ACV: `$200K-$500K`) Tj
T*
(- rough TAM: `$19M-$60M`) Tj
T*
(- rough SAM: `$8M-$18M`) Tj
T*
(- rough SOM: `$2M-$5M`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Sixth Move: State workforce agencies / systems) Tj
T*
(Why later despite strategic importance:) Tj
T*
(- major infrastructure opportunity) Tj
T*
(- strong signaling and policy value) Tj
T*
(- but slower sales cycles, heavier procurement drag, and slower proof) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Indicative economics:) Tj
T*
(- likely ACV: `$500K-$1.5M`) Tj
T*
(- top strategic deployments: `$1.5M-$3M+`) Tj
T*
(- rough TAM: `$38M-$60M`) Tj
T*
(- rough SAM: `$10M-$20M`) Tj
T*
(- rough SOM: `$3M-$8M`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Methodology Summary) Tj
T*
(The recommendation is based on a structured scoring process that combined:) Tj
T*
(- profile-level theoretical attractiveness) Tj
T*
(- representative target scoring) Tj
T*
(- target density) Tj
T*
(- outlier dependency) Tj
T*
(- confidence level) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The buyer profiles were then ranked two ways:) Tj
T*
(- by arithmetic adjusted score) Tj
T*
(- by actual GTM sequencing logic) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(That distinction matters because some profiles, especially employer-connected intermediaries,) Tj
T*
(have sequence value that is larger than their raw average score implies.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Decision Logic) Tj
T*
(The sequencing recommendation is based on one core principle:) Tj
T*
() Tj
ET
